&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern data stack: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience with BigQuery, Airflow, DBT, or similar technologies in production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visualization platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency with Looker, Tableau, or similar BI tools and understanding of how data architecture impacts dashboard performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience designing data systems that power A/B testing and statistical analysis at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working with compliance, legal, or litigation teams on data-related initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
